---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Chips from '../components/Chips.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" current="about">
    <main id="main" class="main prose main--about">
        <h1>About</h1>
        <img class="about-photo" src="/author.png" alt="Hosung Kim’s GitHub profile picture" width="120" height="120" />
        <p>I'm Hosung Kim. This is my notebook for learning in public: working through ideas, reading papers, and turning questions into experiments.</p>
        <p>I'm starting with federated learning. How do we train a useful shared model when the data lives in different places? What changes when those places see different kinds of data?</p>
        <p>These posts begin with the basics and build from there. I'll keep the assumptions visible, distinguish examples from measurements, and update the notes as I learn.</p>
        <Chips />
    </main>
</Layout>
